@page "/"

<PageTitle>CYH Care — No One Should Face the Hospital Alone</PageTitle>

<!-- Emotional Hero Section -->
<div class="hero-gradient text-white py-5 px-3 px-md-5 rounded-4 shadow-lg mb-5 mx-2 mx-md-4 mt-3">
    <div class="container py-4">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-pill bg-white bg-opacity-10 border border-white border-opacity-25 small mb-3">
                    <span class="pulse-live"></span>
                    <span class="text-white-50">People Help People Mission</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="display-4 fw-extrabold mb-3 lh-sm">
                    No One Should Have to Walk the Hospital Corridors <span class="text-warning">Alone.</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="lead text-light opacity-90 mb-4 fs-5 fw-light">
                    When you are miles away at work, in another city, or caught in life's emergencies — 
                    <strong>CYH Care</strong> connects your elderly parents and loved ones with a verified, compassionate local companion who stays by their side just like family.
                </p>

                <!-- Impact Stat Badges -->
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
                    <div class="stat-pill px-3 py-2 text-center">
                        <div class="fw-bold fs-5 text-white">12,500+</div>
                        <div class="small text-white-50">Visits Accompanied</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-pill px-3 py-2 text-center">
                        <div class="fw-bold fs-5 text-white">100%</div>
                        <div class="small text-white-50">KYC Verified Helpers</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-pill px-3 py-2 text-center">
                        <div class="fw-bold fs-5 text-white"><i class="bi bi-star-fill text-warning"></i> 4.9/5</div>
                        <div class="small text-white-50">Compassion Score</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <a href="register" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg px-4 py-3 fw-bold text-dark shadow">
                        <i class="bi bi-heart-fill text-danger me-2 pulse-heart"></i> Request a Companion
                    </a>
                    <a href="register" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-4 py-3">
                        <i class="bi bi-person-heart me-2"></i> Become a Care Helper
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Emotional Hero Visual Card -->
            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <div class="card border-0 rounded-4 bg-white text-dark shadow-lg p-3">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                            <div class="bg-danger bg-opacity-10 p-3 rounded-circle text-danger fs-3">
                                <i class="bi bi-hospital"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">AIIMS Delhi • Live Companion Session</h6>
                                <small class="text-success fw-bold"><span class="pulse-live me-1"></span> Live GPS In-Progress</small>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 bg-light rounded-3 mb-3 small">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-1">
                                <span class="text-muted">Companion:</span>
                                <span class="fw-bold">Rohit Sharma (Verified Helper)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-1">
                                <span class="text-muted">Assisting:</span>
                                <span class="fw-bold">Mr. K.L. Verma (Age 73)</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
                                <span class="text-muted">Current Duty:</span>
                                <span class="text-primary fw-bold">Orthopedic OPD Consultation</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="quote-highlight small my-3">
                            "Mera beta Bangalore mein hai. Rohit ne bilkul bete ki tarah wheelchair chalayi, parchi banwayi aur doctor ke samne haath pakad ke khada raha."
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between pt-2 border-top">
                            <span class="badge badge-soft-success py-2 px-3 rounded-pill">
                                <i class="bi bi-shield-check me-1"></i> Background Verified
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-muted small">Live GPS Tracked</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Why CYH Care Exists — The Emotional Why -->
<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-5 col-lg-8 mx-auto">
        <span class="badge badge-soft-primary px-3 py-2 rounded-pill text-uppercase fw-bold mb-2">Our Heart & Mission</span>
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold">Why We Built CYH Care</h2>
        <p class="text-muted fs-6">
            Hospital visits can be daunting, confusing, and physically exhausting for seniors and vulnerable patients. 
            When family is constrained by distances or commitments, CYH Care ensures respect, empathy, and dignity.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        <!-- Story 1 -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="story-card p-4 h-100">
                <div class="text-danger fs-1 mb-3"><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2">For Distance Families</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                    Working in another state or abroad? You don't have to feel helpless when your parents have doctor checkups. 
                    Get real-time updates and peace of mind.
                </p>
                <div class="quote-highlight small">
                    "I was on a work call in Mumbai while helper Anjali was holding my mother's hand during her dialysis in Delhi."
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Story 2 -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="story-card p-4 h-100">
                <div class="text-primary fs-1 mb-3"><i class="bi bi-sign-turn-right-fill"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2">Navigating Hospital Mazes</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                    OPD registration, billing lines, pathology collection counters, elevator queues. Our helpers take care of the physical run-around so patients can rest.
                </p>
                <div class="quote-highlight small">
                    "Uncle sat peacefully on the bench while our helper cleared all registration tokens and gathered blood reports."
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Story 3 -->
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="story-card p-4 h-100">
                <div class="text-success fs-1 mb-3"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i></div>
                <h5 class="fw-bold mb-2">Absolute Trust & Safety</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                    Every helper is verified through government KYC, police background scrutiny, and admin approval. 
                    Live GPS runs continuously until safely returned.
                </p>
                <div class="quote-highlight small">
                    "Zero compromise on patient dignity, gentleness, and physical safety. Tracked every single meter on the live map."
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Transparent Hourly Pay Banner -->
<div class="container my-4">
    <div class="p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 bg-white border shadow-sm">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-2">Honest, Transparent & Compassionate Pay</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                    Helpers earn fair hourly compensation (₹100/hr standard rate) calculated automatically down to the exact minute of service, 
                    creating dignified community livelihoods while helping those in need.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
                <a href="register" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4 shadow-sm">
                    <i class="bi bi-heart-pulse-fill me-2"></i> Join Our Community
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
